1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,915
Pouring your own soju? Not in Korea.

2
00:00:02,915 --> 00:00:08,326
한 잔 하세요 (han jan haseyo)
Have a drink (please)

3
00:00:08,326 --> 00:00:13,749
두 손으로 (du soneuro)
With two hands

4
00:00:13,749 --> 00:00:18,614
고개 돌려서 마시기 (gogae dollyeoseo masigi)
Turn your head to drink

5
00:00:18,614 --> 00:00:23,114
건배! (geonbae!)
Cheers!
